<title>USA: Chemfab expects record sales, earnings.</title>
<headline>Chemfab expects record sales, earnings.</headline>
<dateline>MERRIMACK, N.H. 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chemfab Corp said Thursday  the outlook for the remainder of the fiscal year, is improving, and industrial product order entry remains strong.</p>
<p>Based on these factors, the company said it continues to expect strong operating cash flows and solid performance, with record sales and earnings for the full fiscal year.</p>
